{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/120500","id":3905187712,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7oxG-A","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120500","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120500.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120500.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120500","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/120500/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/120500/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120500/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/87f1fade30b3169000dc583d63b1f1efcc4e0163","number":120500,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Fix issues in some `Container` types related to maximum size","user":{"login":"StarryWorm","id":41305715,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQxMzA1NzE1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/41305715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm","html_url":"https://github.com/StarryWorm","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\n- Closes #120498\r\n- Closes #120499 \r\n\r\n| Scenario | Before (4.7.stable) | After (with PR) |\r\n| -- | -- | -- |\r\n| `GraphNode` with \"slot\" `StyleBox` | <img width=\"288\" height=\"170\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ae3c9c4c-6221-4446-87f6-2cbf295ef11c\" /> | <img width=\"292\" height=\"174\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/fd988044-e5b8-44c4-895d-661d36ee5ff7\" /> |\r\n| `GraphNode` with \"slot\" `StyleBox` and a child with max size < min size | <img width=\"121\" height=\"324\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/486aefe2-ecbe-4dc6-bdeb-22604753e3f8\" /> | <img width=\"130\" height=\"322\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/000d0c34-9aa8-42d3-87cd-d84be770098b\" /> |\r\n| FlowContainer` with a child with max size < min size | <img width=\"214\" height=\"139\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/4ac82189-a9fe-43ac-b4e8-0c32195303b4\" /> | <img width=\"233\" height=\"131\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/d2047d52-9e58-4c78-83ea-598a4db0f336\" /> |\r\n| `GridContainer` with a child with max height < min height (top left) & one with max width < min width (top center) | <img width=\"229\" height=\"215\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/bdbcaf1f-e366-4da9-a3c5-84c7cc595cfd\" /> | <img width=\"178\" height=\"144\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/05f968cd-fb11-4f7a-94cf-dcc0e859cdd5\" /> |\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nI left the two commits separate since they fix different things, but imho both belong in the same PR, as we need both to fix the \"`GraphNode` with \"slot\" `StyleBox` and a child with max size < min size\" scenario. \r\nLet me know if I should squash since they're fairly small. Or, let me know if I need to split the PRs, in case one but not the other gets flagged for cherry-picking to 4.7.1.\r\n","label